      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">For Level 1B and the fuel efficiency and electric energy consumption from the first 3 phases of a WLTP test in Level 2: For the total number of tests (N) and the measurement results of the tested vehicles, x1, x2, ... xN, the average Xtests and the standard deviation σ shall be determined: [EQ:REG154.04.APPENDIX-2.3.1.2.EQ-1] and [EQ:REG154.04.APPENDIX-2.3.1.2.EQ-2]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
