      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.APPENDIX-2.3.2</data>
      <data key="d20">3.2.1</data>
      <data key="d27">3.2.1</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">71</data>
      <data key="d23">71</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">For Level 1A and the CO2 emissions and electric energy consumption from the 4 phases of a WLTP test in Level 2: For the evaluation of CO2 emissions the normalised values shall be calculated as follows: [EQ:REG154.04.APPENDIX-2.3.2.1.EQ-1] The normalised xi values shall be used to determine the parameters Xtests and s according to paragraph 3.1.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
