      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">For Level 1A and Level 1B and for 3-phase and 4-phase WLTP tests in Level 2</data>
      <data key="d24">For the evaluation of electric energy consumption (EC) the normalised values shall be calculated as follows: [EQ:REG154.04.APPENDIX-2.3.2.3.EQ-1] The normalised x_i values shall be used to determine the parameters X_tests and s according to paragraph 3.1.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
