      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">Criteria emissions of vehicles with at least one combustion engine, of NOVC-HEVs and of OVC-HEVs in case of a charge-sustaining Type 1 test For each driver selectable mode tested the points below shall be repeated (predominant mode or best case mode and worst case mode, if applicable) Test 1a – Results after 4 Phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.1.1.TABLE-U1] [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.1.1.TABLE-U2] Test 1b – Results after 3 Phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.1.1.TABLE-U3] [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.1.1.TABLE-U4] Tests 2a and 2b if applicable: for CO2 reason (dCO2^1) / for pollutants reason (90% of the limits) / for both Record test results in accordance with the table of Tests 1a and 1b, as applicable Tests 3a and 3b if applicable: for CO2 reason (dCO2^2) Record test results in accordance with the table of Tests 1a and 1b, as applicable</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-A1.APP1</data>
    </node>
