      <data key="d24">Electric energy consumption of PEVs (if applicable) Test 1 [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U1] For Level 1A and Level 2 only The parameter listed in paragraph 3.2.(p) or paragraph 3.3.(j) of Appendix 5 to this Regulation is accessible: yes/not applicable Accuracy (if applicable) [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U2] (15) in accordance with Appendix 5 to this Regulation (16) in the case that the OBFCM signal can only be read-out to 2 decimal places, the third decimal place shall be introduced as a zero For Level 1B and Level 2 only The parameters listed in paragraph 3 of Appendix 5 to this Regulation and listed in Appendix 1 of Annex C1 are accessible: yes/not applicable Test 1a – Results after 4 phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U3] Test 1b – Results after 3 phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U4] Tests 2a and 2b (if applicable) Record test results in accordance with the table of Test 1 Tests 3a and 3b – Record test results in accordance with the table of Test 1 Conclusion after 4 phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U5] Conclusion after 3 phase cycle [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U6] Information for COP - Results after 4 Phase cycle (For Level 1A - if applicable) [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U7] Information for COP - Results after 3 Phase cycle (For Level 1B - if applicable) [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U8] For Level 1A and Level 2 only The parameter listed in paragraph 3.2.(p) or paragraph 3.3.(j) of Appendix 5 to this Regulation is accessible: yes/not applicable Accuracy (if applicable) [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-A1.APP1.PART-I.2.1.1.5.2.TABLE-U9] (17) in accordance with paragraph 3.4. of Appendix 2 to this Regulation (18) in accordance with Appendix 5 to this Regulation (19) in the case that the OBFCM signal can only be read-out to 2 decimal places, the third decimal place shall be introduced as a zero For Level 1B and Level 2 only The parameters listed in paragraph 3 of Appendix 5 to this Regulation and listed in Appendix 1 of Annex C1 are accessible: yes/not applicable</data>
