      <data key="d24">Technical Service responsible for carrying out the tests: ..................................... issued by: Name of administration: ...................................... ...................................... ...................................... Test reports. Addendum to type approval communication No ... concerning the type approval of a vehicle with regard to exhaust emissions pursuant to the 04 series of amendments to UN Regulation No. 154</data>
