      <data key="d24">Manufacturer’s Declaration of Compliance with the OBD Requirements for the Purposes of Type-Approval (Manufacturer): ..... (Address of the manufacturer): ..... Declares that: The vehicles covered by this approval / the vehicles listed in Annex I to this declaration (1) are in compliance with the provisions of UN Regulation No. 154 relating to the OBD system; Annex II to this declaration lists any exemptions and/or deficiencies applicable to these vehicles related to the OBD provisions laid down in this Regulation. Done at [..... Place] On [..... Date] [Name and signature of person authorised by the Manufacturer or Manufacturer’s Representative] Attachments Annex I: The Vehicle Type(s), Family(ies) or vehicles described by other vehicle descriptor(s) to which this declaration applies (if applicable). Annex II: list of any exemptions and/or deficiencies applicable to these vehicles related to the OBD provisions laid down in this Regulation (1) delete what is not applicable</data>
