    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.6">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6</data>
      <data key="d20">6.6</data>
      <data key="d27">6.6</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">444</data>
      <data key="d23">444</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">For a vehicle with a positive ignition engine fuelled with LPG</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Subsection"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.6.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.6</data>
      <data key="d20">6.6.1</data>
      <data key="d27">6.6.1</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">444</data>
      <data key="d23">445</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">If the composition of the fuel used for the test differs from the composition that is assumed for the calculation of the normalised consumption, on the manufacturer's request a correction factor cf may be applied, using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.6.1.EQ-1] The correction factor, cf, which may be applied, is determined using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.6.1.EQ-2]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.7">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6</data>
      <data key="d20">6.7</data>
      <data key="d27">6.7</data>
      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">445</data>
      <data key="d23">445</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">For a vehicle with a positive ignition engine fuelled with NG/biomethane</data>
      <data key="d24">[EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.7.EQ-1]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Subsection"]</data>
