      <data key="d21">2</data>
      <data key="d22">499</data>
      <data key="d23">499</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Interpolation of individual vehicle values</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Subsection"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">499</data>
      <data key="d23">499</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Interpolation range</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">499</data>
      <data key="d23">499</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Interpolation range for NOVC- HEVs and OVC-HEVs</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1.1</data>
      <data key="d21">5</data>
      <data key="d22">499</data>
      <data key="d23">499</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">The interpolation method shall only be used if the difference in chargesustaining CO2 over the applicable cycle resulting from the table below between test vehicles L and H is between a minimum of 5 g/km and a maximum defined in paragraph 4.5.1.1.2. of this annex. [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.1.TABLE-U1]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.2">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1.2</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1.2</data>
      <data key="d21">5</data>
      <data key="d22">499</data>
      <data key="d23">499</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">The maximum difference in charge-sustaining CO2 emissions allowed over the applicable cycle resulting from the calculation of the charge-sustaining CO2 emission MCO2,CS from the table below between test vehicles L and H shall be 20 per cent of the charge-sustaining CO2 emissions from vehicle H plus 5 g/km, but shall be at least 15 g/km and not exceed 20 g/km. See Figure A8/3. This restriction does not apply for the application of a road load matrix family or when the calculation of the road load of vehicles L and H is based on the default road load. [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.2.TABLE-U1] [FIGURE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.FIG-A8/3]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.3">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1.3</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1.3</data>
      <data key="d21">5</data>
      <data key="d22">500</data>
      <data key="d23">500</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">The allowed interpolation range defined in paragraph 4.5.1.1.2. of this annex may be increased by 10 g/km charge-sustaining CO2 if a vehicle M is tested within that family and the conditions according to paragraph 4.5.1.1.5. of this annex are fulfilled. This increase is allowed only once within an interpolation family. See Figure A8/4. [FIGURE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.FIG-A8/4]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.4">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1.4</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1.4</data>
      <data key="d21">5</data>
      <data key="d22">500</data>
      <data key="d23">500</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">At the request of the manufacturer and with approval of the responsible authority, the application of the interpolation method on individual vehicle values within a family may be extended if the maximum extrapolation of an individual vehicle resulting from the table below is not more than 3 g/km above the charge-sustaining CO2 emission of vehicle H resulting from the table below and/or is not more than 3 g/km below the charge-sustaining CO2 emission of vehicle L resulting from the table below. This extrapolation is valid only within the absolute boundaries of the interpolation range specified in this paragraph. For the application of a road load matrix family, or when the calculation of the road load of vehicles L and H is based on the default road load, extrapolation is not permitted. [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.4.TABLE-U1]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1.5">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.1.1.5</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.1.1.5</data>
      <data key="d21">5</data>
      <data key="d22">500</data>
      <data key="d23">502</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Vehicle M</data>
      <data key="d24">Vehicle M is a vehicle within the interpolation family between vehicles L and H with a cycle energy demand which is preferably closest to the average of vehicles L and H. The limits of the selection of vehicle M (see Figure A8/5) are such that neither the difference in CO2 emission between vehicles H and M nor the difference in charge-sustaining CO2 emission between vehicles M and L is higher than the allowed charge-sustaining CO2 range according to paragraph 4.5.1.1.2. of this annex. The defined road load coefficients and the defined test mass shall be recorded. [FIGURE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.FIG-A8/5] For Level 1A and 4-phase WLTP test in Level 2 The linearity of the corrected measured and averaged charge-sustaining CO2 emission for vehicle M, MCO2,c,6,M according to step 6 of Table A8/5 of Annex B8, shall be verified against the linearly interpolated charge-sustaining CO2 emission between vehicles L and H over the applicable cycle by using the corrected measured and averaged charge-sustaining CO2 emission MCO2,c,6,H of vehicle H and MCO2,c,6,L of vehicle L, according to step 6 of Table A8/5 of Annex B8, for the linear CO2 emission interpolation. For Level 1B and 3-phase WLTP test in Level 2 An additional averaging of tests using the charge-sustaining CO2-output of step 4a is necessary (not described in Table A8/5). The linearity of the corrected measured and averaged charge-sustaining CO2 emission for vehicle M, M_CO2,c,4a,M according to step 4a of Table A8/5 of Annex B8, shall be verified against the linearly interpolated CO2 emission between vehicles L and H over the applicable cycle by using the corrected measured and averaged chargesustaining CO2 emission MCO2,c,4a,H of vehicle H and MCO2,c,4a,L of vehicle L, according to step 4a of Table A8/5 of Annex B8, for the linear CO2 emission interpolation. For Level 1A, Level 1B and for 3-phase and 4-phase WLTP tests in Level 2 The linearity criterion for vehicle M shall be considered fulfilled if the chargesustaining CO2 emission of vehicle M over the applicable WLTC minus the charge-sustaining CO2 emission derived by interpolation is less than 2 g/km or 3 per cent of the interpolated value, whichever value is less, but at least 1 g/km. See Figure A8/6. [FIGURE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.FIG-A8/6] If the linearity criterion is fulfilled, the interpolation method shall be applicable for all individual vehicle values between vehicles L and H within the interpolation family. If the linearity criterion is not fulfilled, the interpolation family shall be split into two sub-families for vehicles with a cycle energy demand between vehicles L and M, and vehicles with a cycle energy demand between vehicles M and H. In such a case, the final values of e.g. the charge-sustaining CO2 emissions of vehicle M shall be determined according to the same process as for vehicles L or H. See Table A8/5, Table A8/6, Table A8/8 and [TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.TABLE-A8/9] corresponding parameter of vehicle M. For vehicles with a cycle energy demand between that of vehicles M and H, each parameter of vehicle L that is necessary for the application of the interpolation method on individual OVC-HEV and NOVC-HEV values shall be substituted by the corresponding parameter of vehicle M.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.2">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.2</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.2</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">502</data>
      <data key="d23">502</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of energy demand per period</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.2.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.2</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.2.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.2.1</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">502</data>
      <data key="d23">502</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of cycle energy demand (CED) per period</data>
      <data key="d24">The energy demand E_k ,p and distance driven d_c,p per period p applicable for individual vehicles in the interpolation family shall be calculated according to the procedure in paragraph 5. of Annex B7 for the sets k of road load coefficients and masses according to paragraph 3.2.3.2.3. of Annex B7.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.2.2">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.2</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.2.2</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.2.2</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">502</data>
      <data key="d23">502</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of cycle energy demand REESS (CEDREESS) per period for PEVs</data>
      <data key="d24">The energy demand E_k ,p and distance driven d_c,p per period p applicable for the calculation of electric energy consumption and pure electric range of individual vehicles in the interpolation family shall be calculated according to the procedure in Appendix 9 of Annex B8.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.3</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.3</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">502</data>
      <data key="d23">502</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of the interpolation coefficient</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">False</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3.1">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.3.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.3.1</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">502</data>
      <data key="d23">503</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of the interpolation coefficient for individual vehicles K_ind,p for</data>
      <data key="d24">OVC-HEVs and OVC-FCHVs The interpolation coefficient K_ind,p per period shall be calculated for each considered period p using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3.1.EQ-1] In the case that the considered period p is the applicable WLTP test cycle, K_ind,p is named K_ind.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3.2">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.3.2</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.3.2</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">503</data>
      <data key="d23">503</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Calculation of the interpolation coefficient for individual vehicles K_ind,p for</data>
      <data key="d24">PEVs The interpolation coefficient K_ind,p per period shall be calculated for each considered period p using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.3.2.EQ-1] In the case that the considered period p is the applicable WLTP test cycle, K_ind,p is named K_ind.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5</data>
      <data key="d20">4.5.4</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.4</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">503</data>
      <data key="d23">503</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Interpolation of the CO2 emission for individual vehicles</data>
