      <data key="d20">4.5.4.1</data>
      <data key="d27">4.5.4.1</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">503</data>
      <data key="d23">504</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Individual charge-sustaining CO2 emission for OVC-HEVs and NOVC-HEVs</data>
      <data key="d24">For Level 1A and Level 2: The charge-sustaining CO2 emission for an individual vehicle shall be calculated using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4.1.EQ-1] M_CO2−L,CS,p is the charge-sustaining CO2 emission for vehicle L of the considered period p according to Table A8/5, step No. 8, g/km; M_CO2−H,CS,p is the charge-sustaining CO2 emission for vehicle H of the considered period p according to Table A8/5, step No. 8, g/km; Kind,p is the interpolation coefficient for the considered individual vehicle for period p; p is the index of the individual period within the applicable WLTP test cycle. The considered periods shall be the low phase, medium phase, high phase, extra high phase and the applicable WLTP test cycle. For Level 1B: The charge-sustaining CO2 emission for an individual vehicle shall be calculated using the following equation. This calculation is only applied for verification of the extrapolation criterion defined in paragraph 4.5.1.1.4. of this annex: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4.1.EQ-2]</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4.2">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
