      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">504</data>
      <data key="d23">505</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">This paragraph is applicable to Level 1A and Level 2 only: Individual utility factor-weighted CO2 emission for OVC-HEVs The utility factor-weighted CO2 emission for an individual vehicle shall be calculated using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4.3.EQ-1] where: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.4.3.EQ-2] is the utility factor-weighted CO2 emission for an individual vehicle, g/km; is the utility factor-weighted CO2 emission for vehicle L, g/km; is the utility factor-weighted CO2 emission for vehicle H, g/km; is the interpolation coefficient for the considered individual vehicle for the applicable WLTP test cycle.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
