      <data key="d22">508</data>
      <data key="d23">508</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">This paragraph is applicable to Level 1A and 4-phase WLTP test in Level 2 only; Individual utility factor-weighted fuel consumption for OVC-HEVs and OVC- FCHVs The utility factor-weighted fuel consumption for an individual vehicle shall be calculated using the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.4.5.5.3.EQ-1] where: is the utility factor-weighted fuel consumption for an individual vehicle, l/100 km in the case of OVC-HEVs and kg/100km in the case of OVC-FCHVs; FCL,weighted is the utility factor-weighted fuel consumption for vehicle L, l/100 km in the case of OVC-HEVs and kg/100km in the case of OVC-FCHVs; FCH,weighted is the utility factor-weighted fuel consumption for vehicle H, l/100 km in the case of OVC-HEVs and kg/100km in the case of OVC-FCHVs; K_ind is the interpolation coefficient for the considered individual vehicle for the applicable WLTP test cycle.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
