      <data key="d8">NOVC-HEVs and NOVC-FCHVs</data>
      <data key="d24">For NOVC-HEVs and NOVC-FCHVs, one of the following test sequences according to Figure A8.App2/2 shall be used to measure all values that are necessary for the determination of the correction coefficients according to paragraph 2. of this appendix. [FIGURE:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.APP2.FIG-A8]</data>
