      <data key="d23">556</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">REESS adjustment</data>
      <data key="d24">Prior to the test procedure, according to paragraph 3.2.1.3. of this appendix, the manufacturer may adjust the REESS. The manufacturer shall provide evidence that the requirements for the beginning of the test according to paragraph 3.2.1.3. of this appendix are fulfilled.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-B8.APP2</data>
