      <data key="d27">3.1.1</data>
      <data key="d21">3</data>
      <data key="d22">600</data>
      <data key="d23">602</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8">Measured UBE values for OVC-HEVs</data>
      <data key="d24">[TABLE:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.TABLE-U1] [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-1] Parameters Explanation The required input parameter UBEmeasured,nc is calculated as follows: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-2] where: is the measured electric energy change of battery i, (Wh); i is the index number of the considered battery; n is the total number of batteries; and: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-3] where: is the voltage of battery i, V; is the electric current of battery i, A; t_0 is the time at the beginning of the charge-depleting test, s; t_end is the time at the end of the confirmation cycle of the chargedepleting test, s; [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-4] is the conversion factor from Ws to Wh. The required input parameter ∆E_REESS,CC,ave is calculated as follows: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-5] Where: is the average of the measured electric energy change of battery i during the confirmation cycle, (Wh); Parameters Explanation [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-6] is the index number of considered battery; n is the total number of batteries; and [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-7] [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-8] is the time at the end of the confirmation cycle of the chargedepleting test, s; is the conversion factor from Ws to Wh. CC means confirmation cycle as defined in Annex B8, paragraph</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-C1.APP3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.2.4.4">
      <data key="d0">Clause</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d17">Clause</data>
      <data key="d18">decimal</data>
      <data key="d19">REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1</data>
      <data key="d20">3.2.4.4</data>
      <data key="d27">3.2.4.4</data>
      <data key="d21">4</data>
      <data key="d22">602</data>
      <data key="d23">602</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d8" />
      <data key="d24">No rounding shall be applied on UBEmeasured.</data>
      <data key="d25" />
      <data key="d26">True</data>
      <data key="d7">["Provision", "Paragraph"]</data>
      <data key="d29">ANNEX-C1.APP3</data>
    </node>
