      <data key="d29">ANNEX-C1.APP3</data>
      <data key="d48">[602]</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d49">Parameters | Explanation
UBEcertified | UBEcertified | is the adjusted measured usable battery energy (UBE) of the vehicle at
certification:
UBE_certified= UBE_measured@TA∗AF_OVC−HEV
Where:
UBE_measured@TA | is the measured usable battery energy at certification according to
paragraph 3.1.1. of this appendix, Wh;
AF_OVC−HEV | is the adjustment factor determined as described below.
At the option of the Contracting Party, one out of the following two adjustment factors
shall be selected:
- Adjustment factor 1:
AF_OVC−HEV= EC^measured@TA
ECcertified
where:
ECcertified | is the electric energy consumption ECAC.CD according to Annex B8,
Table A8/8, Step no. 14 at certification, Wh/km;
EC_measured@TA is the measured electric energy consumption ECAC,CD according to Annex
B8, Table A8/8, Step no. 13 at certification. Wh/km.
- Adjustment factor 2:
AF_OVC.HEV= EC^measured@TA
ECcertified
where:
ECcertified | is EC according to Annex B8, Table A8/9, Step no. 8 at certification,
Wh/km;
EC_measured@TA is measured EC according to Annex B8, Table A8/9, Step no. 7 at
certification. Wh/km.
UBEcertfied shall be rounded according to paragraph 7 of this Regulation:
- To the nearest whole number if the unit is Wh
- To three significant numbers if the unit is kWh</data>
      <data key="d50">Parameters Explanation UBEcertified UBEcertified is the adjusted measured usable battery energy (UBE) of the vehicle at certification: UBE_certified= UBE_measured@TA∗AF_OVC−HEV Where: UBE_measured@TA is the measured usable battery energy at certification according to paragraph 3.1.1. of this appendix, Wh; AF_OVC−HEV is the adjustment factor determined as described below. At the option of the Contracting Party, one out of the following two adjustment factors shall be selected: - Adjustment factor 1: AF_OVC−HEV= EC^measured@TA ECcertified where: ECcertified is the electric energy consumption ECAC.CD according to Annex B8, Table A8/8, Step no. 14 at certification, Wh/km; EC_measured@TA is the measured electric energy consumption ECAC,CD according to Annex B8, Table A8/8, Step no. 13 at certification. Wh/km. - Adjustment factor 2: AF_OVC.HEV= EC^measured@TA ECcertified where: ECcertified is EC according to Annex B8, Table A8/9, Step no. 8 at certification, Wh/km; EC_measured@TA is measured EC according to Annex B8, Table A8/9, Step no. 7 at certification. Wh/km. UBEcertfied shall be rounded according to paragraph 7 of this Regulation: - To the nearest whole number if the unit is Wh - To three significant numbers if the unit is kWh</data>
