      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d49">Parameters | Explanation
Rangemeasured | Rangemeasured is the measured equivalent all-electric range as defined in the
equation below:
M_CO2,CS − M_CO2,CD,avg
EAER_measured= ( | ) × R_cdc
MCO2,CS
where:
MCO2,CD,avg | is the arithmetic average charge-depleting CO2 mass
emission according to Annex B8, Paragraph 4.4.4.1., g/km;
MCO2,CS | is the charge-sustaining CO2 mass emission according to
Annex B8, Table A8/5 Step no. 5, g/km;
RCDC | is the measured length of the charge-depleting test
according to Annex B8, Table A8/8, Step no. 3, km;
No rounding shall be applied on Rangemeasured.</data>
      <data key="d50">Parameters Explanation Rangemeasured Rangemeasured is the measured equivalent all-electric range as defined in the equation below: EAER_measured= ( M_CO2,CS − M_CO2,CD,avg MCO2,CS ) × R_cdc where: MCO2,CD,avg is the arithmetic average charge-depleting CO2 mass emission according to Annex B8, Paragraph 4.4.4.1., g/km; MCO2,CS is the charge-sustaining CO2 mass emission according to Annex B8, Table A8/5 Step no. 5, g/km; RCDC is the measured length of the charge-depleting test according to Annex B8, Table A8/8, Step no. 3, km; No rounding shall be applied on Rangemeasured.</data>
      <data key="d51">False</data>
