      <data key="d71" />
      <data key="d72">partial</data>
      <data key="d73">Daero = (1 2) × ρ × Af × vr 2(a0 + a1Y + a2Y2 + a3Y3 + a4Y4) Daero = (1 2) × ρ × Af × vr</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-B4.4.3.2.5.3.EQ-2.png</data>
