      <data key="d56">Phase combined value=(CO2\frac{^{ave}L^{L}^{ave}M D \cdot D+ D^{M}+ D+ D^{ave}^{H} \cdot D^{H}^{ave}_{exH} \cdot D^{exH}}{L M H exH} \cdot D) + (CO2 CO2_AF=Phase combined value Declared value) + (CO2) + (CO2)</data>
