      <data key="d73">𝑉𝑖𝑟𝑡𝑢𝑎𝑙 𝑑𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑛𝑐𝑒 (𝑘𝑚) = (𝑡𝑜𝑡𝑎𝑙 𝑑𝑖𝑠𝑐ℎ𝑎𝑟𝑔𝑒 𝑒𝑛𝑒𝑟𝑔𝑦 𝑑𝑢𝑟𝑖𝑛𝑔 𝑉2𝑋 𝑎𝑛𝑑 𝑓𝑜𝑟 𝑛𝑜𝑛−𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑐𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑝𝑢𝑟𝑝𝑜𝑠𝑒𝑠23  (𝑊ℎ) ) 𝑤𝑜𝑟𝑠𝑡 𝑐𝑎𝑠𝑒 𝑐𝑒𝑟𝑡𝑖𝑓𝑖𝑒𝑑 𝑒𝑛𝑒𝑟𝑔𝑦 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑠𝑢𝑚𝑝𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑜𝑓 𝑃𝐴𝑅𝑇 𝐵 𝑓𝑎𝑚𝑖𝑙𝑦  (𝑊ℎ/𝑘𝑚)</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.1.2.EQ-1.png</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.2.1.2.EQ-1">
      <data key="d0">Equation</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d59">p599-r3</data>
      <data key="d44">REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.2.1.2</data>
      <data key="d22">599</data>
      <data key="d60">[184.7, 565.7, 512.1, 639.6]</data>
      <data key="d40">text_layer</data>
      <data key="d61">False</data>
      <data key="d62">vehicle at certification:</data>
      <data key="d63" />
      <data key="d64">[]</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d65" />
      <data key="d66" />
      <data key="d67">equation</data>
      <data key="d68">UBE UBE_{measured@TA}_certified= UBE*AF_{measured@TA}_PER UBE UBE_{measured@TA}_certified=UBE_{measured@TA}*AF_PER</data>
      <data key="d56">UBE UBE_{measured@TA}_{certified}= UBE \cdot AF_{measured@TA}_{PER}UBE UBE_{measured@TA}_{certified}=UBE_{measured@TA} \cdot AF_{PER}</data>
      <data key="d69">UBE_UBE_measured@TA_certified</data>
      <data key="d70">["UBE", "UBE_measured@TA_certified", "AF_measured@TA_PER", "UBE_measured@TA", "AF_PER", "UBE_UBE_measured@TA_certified", "AF_measured@TA_PER_UBE_UBE_measured@TA_certified"]</data>
      <data key="d71" />
      <data key="d72">parsed</data>
      <data key="d73">𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑐𝑒𝑟𝑡𝑖𝑓𝑖𝑒𝑑= 𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑@𝑇𝐴 𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑐𝑒𝑟𝑡𝑖𝑓𝑖𝑒𝑑= 𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑@𝑇𝐴∗𝐴𝐹𝑃𝐸𝑅 ∗𝐴𝐹𝑃𝐸𝑅 𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑@𝑇𝐴 𝑈𝐵𝐸𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑@𝑇𝐴</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.2.1.2.EQ-1.png</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-1">
      <data key="d0">Equation</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d59">p600-r5</data>
      <data key="d44">REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1</data>
      <data key="d22">600</data>
      <data key="d60">[248.6, 515.4, 497.9, 547.2]</data>
      <data key="d40">text_layer</data>
      <data key="d61">False</data>
      <data key="d62">UBEmeasured shall be the usable battery energy calculated as follows:</data>
      <data key="d63" />
      <data key="d64">[{"symbol": "UBE_measured,nc", "symbol_text": "UBEmeasured,nc", "description": "the non-corrected usable battery energy of the chargedepleting test, (Wh)", "unit": "Wh"}, {"symbol": "Delta_E_REESS,CC,nc", "symbol_text": "∆E_REESS,CC,nc", "description": "the non-corrected electric energy change of the confirmation cycle, Wh", "unit": "Wh"}, {"symbol": "Delta_E_REESS,CC,ave", "symbol_text": "∆E_REESS,CC,ave", "description": "the average electric energy change of the confirmation cycle, (Wh)", "unit": "Wh"}, {"symbol": "CC", "symbol_text": "CC", "description": "confirmation cycle as defined in UN-R154 Annex 8, paragraph 3.2.4.4.", "unit": null}]</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d65" />
      <data key="d66" />
      <data key="d67">equation</data>
      <data key="d68">UBE_measured= UBE_{measured,nc}-(ΔE_{REESS,CC,nc}-ΔE_{REESS,CC,ave})</data>
      <data key="d56">UBE_{measured}= UBE_{measured,nc}-(\Delta E_{REESS,CC,nc}-\Delta E_{REESS,CC,ave})</data>
      <data key="d69">UBE_measured</data>
      <data key="d70">["UBE_measured", "UBE_measured,nc", "Delta_E_REESS,CC,nc", "Delta_E_REESS,CC,ave"]</data>
      <data key="d71" />
      <data key="d72">parsed</data>
      <data key="d73">𝑈BE𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑= UBE𝑚𝑒𝑎𝑠𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑑,𝑛𝑐−(∆𝐸REESS,CC,nc−∆𝐸𝑅𝐸𝐸𝑆𝑆,𝐶𝐶,𝑎𝑣𝑒)</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-1.png</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-2">
      <data key="d0">Equation</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d59">p601-r2</data>
      <data key="d44">REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1</data>
      <data key="d22">601</data>
      <data key="d60">[227.5, 415.9, 431.0, 493.2]</data>
      <data key="d40">text_layer</data>
      <data key="d61">False</data>
      <data key="d62">The required input parameter UBEmeasured,nc is calculated as follows:</data>
      <data key="d63" />
      <data key="d64">[]</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d65" />
      <data key="d66" />
      <data key="d67">equation</data>
      <data key="d68">ΔE_{REESS,i}UBE_{measured,nc}=_{i=1}sum ^{n}ΔE_{REESS,i}</data>
      <data key="d56">\Delta E_{REESS,i}UBE_{measured,nc}=_{i=1}\sum ^{n}\Delta E_{REESS,i}</data>
      <data key="d69">Delta_E_REESS,iUBE_measured,nc</data>
      <data key="d70">["Delta_E_REESS,i", "UBE_measured,nc", "i", "n", "Delta_E_REESS,iUBE_measured,nc", "1sum_^nDelta_E_REESS,i"]</data>
      <data key="d71" />
      <data key="d72">partial</data>
      <data key="d73">n UBEmeasured,nc = ∑∆EREESS,i i=1 ∆𝐸𝑅𝐸𝐸𝑆𝑆,𝑖</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-2.png</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-3">
      <data key="d0">Equation</data>
      <data key="d1">REG154.04</data>
      <data key="d59">p601-r3</data>
      <data key="d44">REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1</data>
      <data key="d22">601</data>
      <data key="d60">[227.5, 523.9, 468.6, 620.8]</data>
      <data key="d40">text_layer</data>
      <data key="d61">False</data>
      <data key="d62">and:</data>
      <data key="d63" />
      <data key="d64">[]</data>
      <data key="d28">True</data>
      <data key="d65" />
      <data key="d66" />
      <data key="d67">equation</data>
      <data key="d68">U(t)I(t)_{REESS,i}_{REESS,i}ΔE_{REESS,i}=3600 1*^{t}int_{t_0} ^{end}U(t)_{REESS,i}* I(t)_{REESS,i}dt</data>
      <data key="d56">U(t)I(t)_{REESS,i}_{REESS,i}\Delta E_{REESS,i}=3600 1 \cdot ^{t}\int_{t_{0}} ^{end}U(t)_{REESS,i} \cdot I(t)_{REESS,i}dt</data>
      <data key="d69">U(t)I(t)_REESS,i_REESS,iDelta_E_REESS,i</data>
      <data key="d70">["U(t)", "I(t)_REESS,i", "REESS", "i", "Delta_E_REESS,i", "t", "int_t_0", "U(t)_REESS,i", "REESS,i_REESS,iDelta_E_REESS,i", "^tint_t_0_^endU"]</data>
      <data key="d71" />
      <data key="d72">partial</data>
      <data key="d73">tend 1 3600× ∫U(t)REESS,i × I(t)REESS,i dt ∆EREESS,i = t0 U(t)REESS,i I(t)REESS,i</data>
      <data key="d74">equations/REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-3.png</data>
    </node>
    <node id="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.3.1.1.EQ-5">
