      <data key="d91">cites</data>
      <data key="d92">UN Regulation No. 83</data>
      <data key="d93">The preceding approval mark affixed to a vehicle in conformity with paragraph 5. of this Regulation shows that the vehicle type concerned has been approved in France (E2), pursuant to: Number of Regulation (Regulation No. 154) Series of amendments No. Section 3 of Approval number a E11 154 R – 002439 – 02 a/2 a/3 a/3 E11154R – 002439 – 1A E2154R – 002439 – 1A 83 R – 089876 – ZA (a) UN Regulation N</data>
      <data key="d94">direct</data>
    </edge>
