      <data key="d92">ISO 4259</data>
      <data key="d93">In establishing of their limit values the terms of ISO 4259 "Petro leum products - Determination and application of precision data in relation to methods of test" have been applied and in fixing a m inimum value, a minimum difference of 2R above zero has been taken into account; in fixing a maximum and minimum value, the minimum differe nce is</data>
      <data key="d94">footnote</data>
    </edge>
