      <data key="d92">SAE J2572</data>
      <data key="d93">Fuel consumption for a vehicle with a positive ignition engine fuelled by hydrogen: For vehicles fuelled either with gaseous or liquid hydrogen, and with approval of the responsible authority, the manufacturer may choose to calculate fuel consumption using either the equation for FC below or a method using a standard protocol such as SAE J2572. [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B7.6.13.EQ-1] The compressibility</data>
