      <data key="d91">cites</data>
      <data key="d92">UN Regulation No. 83</data>
      <data key="d93">For the approval of OVC-HEVs or OVC-FCHVs of category M1 or N1 with emission characters EA, EB or EC as referred to in Table A3/1 of Annex 3 to the 08 series of amendment to UN Regulation No. 83, the fractional utility factor UF_j for the weighting of period j, shall be calculated in accordance with the following equation: [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.APP5.2.EQ-1] [EQ:REG154.04.ANNEX-B8.APP5.2.EQ-2] sum</data>
