      <data key="d92">ISO 5725 Part 6 Annex 8</data>
      <data key="d93">The basic principle for the determination of accuracy and precision of candidate and reference methods shall follow the guidelines in ISO 5725 Part 6 Annex 8 "Comparison of alternative Measurement Methods".</data>
