      <data key="d90">CITES</data>
      <data key="d91">cites</data>
      <data key="d92">ISO 15031-5</data>
      <data key="d93">Standards used for the transmission of OBD relevant information: (a) ISO 15031-5 "Road vehicles - communication between vehicles and external test equipment for emissions-related diagnostics – Part 5: Emissions-related diagnostic services", dated 1 April 2011 or SAE J1979 dated 23 February 2012;</data>
      <data key="d94">direct</data>
    </edge>
