      <data key="d90">DESCRIBED_AS</data>
      <data key="d100">the measured hydrocarbon concentration in the enclosure, ppm volume in C1 equivalent; V is the net enclosure volume corrected for the volume of the vehicle with the windows and the luggage compartment open, m . If the volume of the vehicle is not known, a volume of 1.42 m shall be subtracted</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.7.1.1.EQ-1" target="REG154.04.VAR:Ti" id="0">
