    <edge source="REG154.04.ANNEX-C1.APP3.7.1.1.EQ-1" target="REG154.04.VAR:H/C" id="1">
      <data key="d90">DESCRIBED_AS</data>
      <data key="d100">taken to be 2.33 for puff loss overflow measurement in SHED and diurnal test losses; H/C is taken to be 2.20 for hot soak losses; H/C is taken to be 2.67 for calibration; k is 1.2 × 10^-4 × (12 + H/C), (g × K/(m3 × kPa)); i is the initial reading; f is the final reading.</data>
    </edge>
